    <string name="memory_menu_syntax_help_button_cd">Search syntax help</string>
    <string name="memory_menu_syntax_help_text"><b>1. Mantissa / Exponent (Scientific / BigDouble):</b>\n• <i>1.5e6</i> or <i>1.5,6</i> or <i>1.5:6</i>\n• Type: Select BigDouble or type <i>bigdouble:1.5,6</i>\n\n<b>2. Obscured / Encrypted (Anti-Cheat XOR):</b>\n• Select Obscured Int or Obscured Float\n• Or use prefix: <i>xor:1000</i> or <i>obscured:1000</i>\n\n<b>3. Float Tolerance / Epsilon:</b>\n• Absolute margin: <i>100.0 +- 0.5</i>\n• Percentage margin: <i>100 +- 2%</i>\n\n<b>4. Scaled Fixed-Point:</b>\n• Multiplier formula: <i>10.5 * 1000</i> (searches 10500)\n• Or prefix: <i>scaled:10.5:1000</i>\n\n<b>5. Heterogeneous Struct Group:</b>\n• Mixed types: <i>f64:1.5; i64:6 : 16</i>\n• Or: <i>f32:100.0; i32:50; byte:1 : 32</i></string>
